      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yes please.. it would also be great to support some third party/open source input solutions like the steamvr skeletal input.. I've been asking this since 2018 and nothing ever happened.. I was told to ride on the \"knuckles drivers\".. it defeats the purpose to emulate a controller because it means you won't add anything that the existing controller already could do.. which defeats the purpose of new solutions. (Which drives the industry forward).. it's a shame because VRchat is such a large title that their moves would make a big impact on VR solutions.\nHere is a sort of request I did back in 2018: https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/knucklesindex-controller-support-compressed-skeletal-hand-input",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
